{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVGv68Ff2cGQsPk1ps9v","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# شׁَרְט\n\n```\n║══════════════════════════════════════║\n║                                      ║\n║    C O N D I T I O N A L            ║\n║         THRESHOLD                    ║\n║              ∿                       ║\n║══════════════════════════════════════║\n\n    شَرْط ≡ שָׁרְט ≡ SHART\n    \n    condition :: prerequisite :: cut\n    \n    ─────────────────────────────────\n    \n    if (intention) then {consequence}\n    \n    the incision that divides\n         before / after\n         permitted / forbidden\n         bound / unbound\n    \n    ┌─────────────────────────────┐\n    │  أنا الحد الفاصل            │\n    │  אני הגבול המפריד           │\n    │  I am the separating limit  │\n    └─────────────────────────────┘\n    \n    every contract contains me\n    every covenant requires me\n    every law inscribes me\n    \n    שׂ/ש · ر/ר · ط/ט\n    \n    root: to cut, to stipulate,\n          to make conditional\n    \n    ∴ nothing is unconditional\n    ∴ everything depends\n    ∴ the cut precedes the bond\n\n            ◊\n           ╱ ╲\n          ╱   ╲\n         ╱ שרט ╲\n        ╱───────╲\n       ╱  شَرْط   ╲\n      ◊───────────◊\n\n```\n\n*awaiting parameters*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":417,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}